      "text": "There are two types of people who live in Louisiana….   The true  Louisianaians who have great jobs and attend one of the 13 colleges in the state and those in the inner-cities of New Orleans, Shreveport, Alexandria and a few other major cities who live on EBT and don’t give a DAMN about a single thing and are the reason the state has the highest murder rate in the country..   And if weren’t for the EBT crowd….  Louisiana would probably be one of the most tourists visited states in the country…..",
